;Normal sale, assumes already logged in

Alias scanfield 60 674
Alias complete_sale 1758 740
Alias dialog 506 366
Alias vendor_coupon 97 539
Alias "Amount tendered" 451 394
Alias cash 45 138
Alias payment_choices_top 552 173
Alias print_least 484 250

Assert color 86 13 #000091 ;ensures someone is logged in

Mouseclick scanfield
TypeText 5413121360772 ;belgian choc
PressKey Enter
Sleep 5000

MouseClick complete_sale
sleep 1000

Assert memo dialog "Club+ card If your customer has a Club+ card, ask them to scan it now on the Customer Scanner"
ClickButton formDlg "No Card"
Sleep 200

////////// START VENDOR COUPON //////////

MouseClick vendor_coupon
ClickButton Payment OK
Sleep 500

MouseClick "Amount tendered" //this is the input box for the amount
PressKey Backspace
PressKey Backspace
PressKey Backspace
PressKey Backspace
PressKey Backspace
TypeText 100
ClickButton "Vendor Coupon" OK
Sleep 200

////////// START CASH //////////

MouseClick cash
ClickButton Payment OK
MouseClick payment_choices_top
MouseClick print_least
Sleep 1000 ;allows time to complete the sale, ready for next test
